<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏfāno</span></b> ,
			āvi, atum, 1, v. a.
		profanus. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to render unholy</i>,
				<i>deprive of sanctity</i>, <i>to
				unhallow</i>, <i>desecrate</i>, <i>profane</i> (perh. not ante - Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies festos, sacra, sacerdotes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					31, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 3, 9, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">festum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					4, 390</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">funus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 9, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sabbata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Ezech. 23, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">justitias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Psa. 88, 32</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To violate</i>, <i>pollute</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pudorem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					5, 1, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 1, 84</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Decl. 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To disclose</i>, <i>reveal</i>, <i>betray</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">secreta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 164, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res profanata non valeat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 35, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
